# Test tooling for the CI and Publish test gates, pinned with hashes so a run
# installs exactly what was reviewed, with the runtime dependencies at the
# versions the conformance corpus is run against. The package itself installs
# afterwards with --no-deps --no-build-isolation, so setuptools and wheel, its
# build backend, come from this lock too. Compiled for the oldest Python the
# test matrix runs, so one lock serves 3.10 to 3.13 on every runner:
#   uv pip compile test.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.10 -o test.txt
# Dependabot proposes each new release.
